  "body": "Salvage of the unique remainder of closed archive PR #7528 (task 14206, issue #7297 salvage programme, routed by triage task 13841).\n\nRemainder: pkgs/id/crates/id-core/tests/probe_petname_load.rs (28 lines, new file) — the only file in PR #7528 diff, absent from current main.\n\nVerification (fresh, this task):\n- API surface unchanged on current main: Petnames::open / get / of_owner / set all present in pkgs/id/crates/id-core/src/petname.rs; petname module is in default features (world).\n- Targeted test on the laptop against this branch: cargo test -p id-core --test probe_petname_load — 1 passed (probe_open_replays_names_set_would_refuse). The probe finding stands on current main: Petnames::open replays journal records verbatim that Petnames::set would refuse (fold-equal conflict, format-char, overlong). This test characterizes that behavior so a future validation-on-replay fix trips it deliberately.\n- Diff is exactly the salvaged file, nothing else.\n\nClosed PR #7528 was not reopened and its archive branch was not recreated; its head ref was the diff source only.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796791540&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7952&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7952&signature=ef8a776723b5e0dd44ca90c23ccc44a11125258716be47939993906335f991b0\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7952?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
